# Eikonal variant on the pig Purkinje tree (Allrun eikonal pig).
#
# Single steady solve, writes only time 1 (see injection.eikonal.reference).
# The pig tree reaches this probe 0.38 ms later than the human tree
# (0.0058399): its junctions near the probe sit at different positions and
# mostly inside the wall. The eikonal coupling has no source-sink load, so
# the delay is geometric only.
#
# file                                  time   col  expected      tolerance
injectionProbe/0/activationTime         1      2    0.00621733    1e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.025  5    0.003668100   2e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.035  3   -0.004851966   2e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.04   7    0.005573608   2e-4
